@startuml system-activity
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam activityBorderColor #5B5EA6
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EEF0FB
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3CD
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #D4A017
skinparam arrowColor #5B5EA6
skinparam fontName "Helvetica"
skinparam swimlaneBackgroundColor #F5F7FF
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor #9999CC

title Radovid Bot — System Activity Diagram (Component Interaction)

|Discord Client|
|Discord API (Gateway)|
|Bot Handler (Delivery Layer)|
|Use Case Layer|
|Domain Logic|
|Ollama Client|
|SQLite Repository|

== Discord Bot Command Flow ==

|Discord Client|
start
:User inputs slash command\n(e.g. /radovid start word_chain easy);

|Discord API (Gateway)|
:Discord Gateway receives\nInteraction event;
:Dispatches **InteractionCreate**\nevent to connected bot;

|Bot Handler (Delivery Layer)|
:DiscordGo receives event;
:Route to correct handler\nbased on CommandName + Subcommand\n(e.g. radovid_start.go);
:Parse and validate\ncommand options\n(game_type, difficulty, etc.);
:Send **Deferred Interaction Response**\n(shows "Bot is thinking…");

|Use Case Layer|
:Invoke relevant Use Case\n(e.g. StartSessionUseCase);

|Domain Logic|
:Apply business rules:\n- Check channel availability\n- Create GameSession entity\n- Validate game type & difficulty;

|SQLite Repository|
:Read existing active sessions\nfor channel_id;

|Use Case Layer|
if (Active session exists?) then (yes)
  |Bot Handler (Delivery Layer)|
  :Edit deferred response:\nEphemeral error embed;
  |Discord Client|
  :User sees error message;
  stop
else (no)
endif

|SQLite Repository|
:INSERT new game_session (status=PENDING);
:INSERT session_participants (host);

|Ollama Client|
:POST /api/generate to Ollama\n(localhost:11434)\nwith game prompt template + context;\nnote right: Context timeout applied\n(OLLAMA_TIMEOUT_SECONDS)

if (Ollama responds in time?) then (no)
  |Bot Handler (Delivery Layer)|
  :Edit deferred response:\nError embed "AI is busy, try again";
  stop
else (yes)
endif

|Ollama Client|
:Stream and aggregate\ngenerated text response;

|Use Case Layer|
:Prepare session data + AI prompt\nfor Discord embed;

|Bot Handler (Delivery Layer)|
:Edit deferred response:\nGame session embed\n(game info + player prompt + join CTA);

|Discord Client|
:User sees game session embed\nin channel;

== Round Processing (Game Loop) ==

|Discord Client|
:Players respond with\nfree-text messages in channel;

|Bot Handler (Delivery Layer)|
:DiscordGo receives MessageCreate event;
:Filter messages by channel_id + session_id;

|Use Case Layer|
:Invoke GameMasterUseCase.ProcessRound();

|Ollama Client|
:POST to Ollama:\nPlayer responses + correction request;

|SQLite Repository|
:INSERT game_round record;\n:INSERT feedback_log entries;

|Bot Handler (Delivery Layer)|
:Post AI feedback embed to channel\n(corrections + hints);

== Session Completion ==

|Use Case Layer|
:Calculate XP, update streak, check achievements;

|SQLite Repository|
:UPDATE user_progress;\n:INSERT achievements (if any);\n:UPDATE game_session (status=COMPLETED, ended_at);

|Bot Handler (Delivery Layer)|
:Post session summary embed\n(XP earned, level ups, achievements);

|Discord Client|
:Players see final results;

== HTMX Admin Dashboard Flow ==

|Discord Client|
detach

|Discord API (Gateway)|
detach

|Bot Handler (Delivery Layer)|
detach

|Use Case Layer|
detach

|Domain Logic|
detach

|Ollama Client|
detach

|SQLite Repository|

' Swimlane reset for dashboard
|#E8F8F5|Browser (Admin)|
|#E8F8F5|HTTP Handler (Delivery Layer)|
|SQLite Repository|

|#E8F8F5|Browser (Admin)|
:Admin navigates to\n/admin or /admin/sessions;
:Sends HTTP GET request\nwith Basic Auth header;

|#E8F8F5|HTTP Handler (Delivery Layer)|
:Basic Auth middleware\nvalidates credentials;

if (Auth valid?) then (no)
  |#E8F8F5|Browser (Admin)|
  :Browser shows 401 Unauthorized;
  stop
else (yes)
endif

|SQLite Repository|
:Query sessions / users / stats\n(read-only SELECT);

|#E8F8F5|HTTP Handler (Delivery Layer)|
:Render HTML template\nwith data (Go text/template);
:Return full page or HTMX partial\nbased on hx-request header;

|#E8F8F5|Browser (Admin)|
:HTMX swaps response\ninto the DOM (partial update)\nor renders full page;
stop

@enduml
